# Shared lib (`popup/src/lib/`)

Used by **popup** and **background** (imported via relative paths).

| Module | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `storage.js` | `getStorage`, `setStorage`, `mergeStorage`, defaults (`cv_text`, `user_profile`, `license`, `job_queue`) |
| `ai.js` | `callAI`, `parseApplicationResponse` — Anthropic + OpenAI |
| `prompts.js` | `buildApplicationPrompts`, `PROMPTS.*` — JSON-only responses |
| `prompt-parts.js` | `preferences.promptParts` toggles for cost control |
| `license.js` | Free tier (15), `validateLicense`, `canSubmitApplication` |
| `db.js` | IndexedDB `blitz_db` / `applications` store (`listingKey` index, v2) |
| `application-store.js` | `persistGeneratedApplication`, `persistFilledApplication`, events, `loadApplicationIntoPending` |
| `api-usage-log.js` | `recordApiUsage`, IndexedDB `api_usage` store (v3) — local API transaction log |
| `word-html-sanitize.js` | `decodeWordHtmlBytes`, `sanitizeWordImportedHtml` — fix Word .htm encoding () |
| `config.js` | `LICENSE_ENDPOINT`, LemonSqueezy URLs |
| `pdf.js` / `cv-export.js` | Request PDF; `buildRenderedCvHtml` for offscreen |
| `cv-template-engine.js`, `cv-template-default.js`, `cv-document.js`, `cv-html.js` | HTML CV template + sanitised rich fields |
| `application-history-utils.js` | `displayApplicationLabel` (`{Role} — {Company}`) |
| `job-listing.js` | `listingKey`, `applicationMatchesJob` — match card / review tied to one listing |
| `humanize-text.js` | `stripEmDashes` — remove em dashes from AI output |
| `extension-env.js` | `isExtensionPage`, `sendExtensionMessage`, web bridge |
| `pdf-parse.js` | PDF → text in Settings (pdfjs-dist) |
| `queue-utils.js` | `detectPlatformFromUrl`, parse bulk job URLs |

## Config

License URL: `config.js` → `LICENSE_ENDPOINT`. Update when worker URL changes.

## Security

Never log `apiKey` or `cv_text`. API key only in `ai.js` fetch headers.
